# derived/ IS committed: the analyse workflow regenerates and pushes it so the
# tables are readable on GitHub without cloning and running R. Raw data under
# data/ is the source of truth; everything in derived/ can be rebuilt from it.
#
# ...with one exception. flow_with_weather.csv is 10.5 MB and is exactly
# hourly_flow.csv joined to weather_hourly.csv, both of which ARE committed.
# Re-committing it on every scheduled analysis would add more history than the
# raw observations do. 04_join_and_analyse.R still writes it locally whenever
# you need the station-level joined table.
/derived/flow_with_weather.csv

# Figures are regenerated by R/05_explore.R from derived/ in seconds.
/figures/
